flowchart LR
UC["User Chat"]
ORCH["Orchestrator Agent<br/>Routes and Assembles"]
AG["Restaurants Agent - restaurant_agent<br/>LangGraph Deep Agent<br/>Ollama lfm2.5 default, hosted via RESTAURANT_AGENT_MODEL<br/>answer task - one self-contained message, never asks back<br/>No planning. No sub-task decomposition. No sub-agents."]
MEM["Within-call memory<br/>original task string retained<br/>Stateless between calls"]
T1["Semantic Restaurant Search<br/>find_restaurants - query, city, cuisine, price, min_rating, dietary"]
T2["Hard-Constraint Filter<br/>city, cuisine, price, min rating, dietary<br/>NO LLM on this path"]
T3["Reflection Step<br/>relax one soft constraint, re-query<br/>hard stop at 2 attempts"]
T4["Dynamic Corpus Expansion<br/>fetch_live_restaurants - city"]
D1[("Restaurant Corpus<br/>Chroma, 28 curated records<br/>own store, same engine and embedding model as destination_data<br/>Vector DB")]
D2["Dietary and Budget Rules<br/>derived deterministically from the task string<br/>Local logic - no model"]
D3["OpenStreetMap Overpass<br/>no API key, no billing<br/>REST API"]
UC --->|INPUT is one task string| ORCH
ORCH --->|A2A Restaurants Task| AG
AG --->|OUTPUT is top pick plus two alternatives plus Adjusted line| ORCH
AG -.->|reads| MEM
AG --->|LLM CALL 1 chooses tool arguments| T1
AG ---> T2
AG ---> T3
AG ---> T4
T3 --->|re-query with one constraint relaxed| T1
T1 --->|vector retrieval| D1
T2 --->|constraint check| D2
MEM -.->|task string re-read for dietary needs| D2
T4 --->|live fetch when a city is new| D3
T4 --->|writes new records back| D1
K0["KEY<br/>every property<br/>carries meaning"]
K1["COLOUR<br/>kind of thing,<br/>not importance<br/>grey human<br/>purple orchestration<br/>yellow this agent<br/>green a tool<br/>blue a data source<br/>orange memory"]
K2["SHAPE<br/>cylinder stores data<br/>and is written to<br/>rectangle is called<br/>and returns"]
K3["THICKNESS<br/>a thicker border marks<br/>a component with a<br/>measured guarantee"]
K4["LINE<br/>solid is data or<br/>control flow<br/>dashed is a read of<br/>retained state"]
K5["X POSITION<br/>left to right is<br/>distance from the user<br/>human, orchestrator,<br/>agent, tools, data"]
K6["LINE CROSSING<br/>none - related boxes<br/>are placed adjacent<br/>so no line has to cross"]
K0 ~~~ K1 ~~~ K2 ~~~ K3 ~~~ K4 ~~~ K5 ~~~ K6
